2026-10-21T22:28:06.4657121Z # One-shot retained native Rust parser: shadow low-level experiment
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4658216Z 
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4659310Z This reports parser/kernal phase economics, NOT a new accepted receipt or full producer-to-durable lifecycle speedup.
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4661295Z Baseline parsed once on session startup (charged separately). Each compared changed export uses genuine source-owned Lean data.
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4662687Z Original full Rust selected checker and fresh Rust/C++/paranoid full oracles remain acceptance authorities.
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4663374Z 
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4663923Z | Workload / edit | Fresh selected checker | Retained parsed-state checker | Median savings | Delta parse+finish |
