2026-10-21T22:28:06.4669045Z | original / early-definition | 0.061893s | 0.041208s | 33.42% | 0.000150s |
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4669865Z | original / unrelated-definition | 0.027961s | 0.001831s | 93.45% | 0.000171s |
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4670665Z | expanded / early-definition | 0.138643s | 0.075061s | 45.86% | 0.000503s |
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4671298Z | expanded / unrelated-definition | 0.107583s | 0.045325s | 57.87% | 0.000512s |
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4671702Z 
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4672288Z Same-kernel parity on accepted real source, genuine typed full-index oracle, protected malformed/overwrite delta parser refusals required.
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4673599Z New retained parser executable semantics are not machine-proven. The producer, attestation and HMAC policy are also outside the kernel proof.
2026-10-21T22:28:06.4674788Z Cold startup, arbitrary Lean declarations/topology and true end-to-end change-proportional checking remain UNKNOWN.
