2026-10-21T22:44:40.3200783Z # Same-source retained-kernel receipt issuance: shared JSON comparison versus canonical JSON comparison.
2026-10-21T22:44:40.3201561Z 
2026-10-21T22:44:40.3202154Z Same source-owned producer, HMAC authentication, conservative reuse, full sealed input and signed sparse receipts.
2026-10-21T22:44:40.3203453Z Every arm has independent full Rust/index/partition/receipt audits; first pairs also have full C++ and paranoid checks.
2026-10-21T22:44:40.3205094Z Warm apply excludes initial setup. Cold replay and setup plus one apply components are separate; no update-stream amortization.
2026-10-21T22:44:40.3206252Z 
2026-10-21T22:44:40.3206754Z | Source / edit | Canonical JSON warm (s) | Shared JSON warm (s) | Saving | Wins | Bootstrap 95% ratio | Gate |
